mso-themetint:191"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;mso-themecolor:text1;
mso-themetint:191">One person decides to host a blood drive. Forty people come
and give blood. Each donation can save up to three lives. That’s over 100 lives
impacted. Repeat three or four times a year, and one person’s decision to host
blood drives could help save hundreds of lives in the community each year!</span><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><blockquote style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;
