support the community blood supply and give your colleagues or neighbors an
opportunity to help save lives. Just try it and you’ll be hooked on the good
feeling that comes with touching so many lives!</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><b>Give us a try!</b>&nbsp;Please reach out to us at&nbsp;</span><font color="#404040" face="Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">{!Lead.OwnerPhone}</span></font><span style="color: rgb(112, 111, 114); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">or visit </span><a href="http://www.redcrossblood.org/hosting-blood-drive" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size:
